NNAAMMEE
       pammixinterlace - mix adjacent lines to merge interlaced images


SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
       ppaammmmiixxiinntteerrllaaccee

       [--ffiilltteerr=={lliinneeaarr, ffiirr, ffffmmppeegg}]

       [--aaddaappttiivvee]

